            "type": "enforcement",
            "statement": "Reject all executable content even when the extension or MIME type is misleading.",
            "strategy": "Implement a dual-layer validation: (a) Static pattern matching on file magic numbers against a known-bad signature list; (b) Heuristic analysis of binary headers and string patterns common in executables. Reject immediately upon detection without storing to durable bucket.",
